# Copy to .dev.vars for `wrangler dev`. In production: `wrangler secret put CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN`.
#
# P1 only: an account-owned Cloudflare API token for the account in
# CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID (wrangler.jsonc vars), with "Workers Scripts: Edit".
# P2 moves it into the Vault DO.
CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=
